  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1...Hot and humid weather likely next week.\n\nMajor pattern change starts late this weekend and early next week \nas ridging builds across the Great Lakes and then amplification\nintensifies over the eastern CONUS through next week. Heights \nbuilding to ~596 dm next week over the Ohio Valley will set the \nstage for stage for a hot and humid airmass across western and \nnorth central New York, with the potential for multiple \nconsecutive days of 90+ degree weather and even hotter heat \nindices from Tuesday through Friday. Heat-related headlines will\nbe likely during this period, as the likelihood for dangerous \nheat indices increase. Some relief from the heat is possible \nduring the mid week period with the potential for showers and \nthunderstorms, but predictability is too low at this forecast \nrange.",
